We will also be adding additional tools and code to this repository that we found useful in our day-to-day work, including:
- **OCR for removing burned-in DICOM annotations** 📝
- More **privacy-preserving utilities** to enhance the anonymization of medical imaging data
- And other useful features that improve CT scan processing and anonymization 💻
